      assign d_inci = 'Water/Aqua, Coco-Glucoside, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Glycerin, Sodium Cocoamphoacetate, Lauryl Glucoside, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Niacinamide, Benzyl Alcohol, Sodium Cocoyl Glutamate, Sodium Lauryl Glucose Carboxylate, Hydroxypropyl Starch Phosphate, Rosmarinus Officinalis Leaf Extract, Hydroxypropylammonium Gluconate, Hydroxypropyl Gluconamide, Caesalpinia Spinosa Gum, Citrus Paradisi Peel Oil, Benzoic Acid, Hydrolyzed Quinoa, Panthenol, Dehydroacetic Acid, Amaranthus Caudatus Seed Extract, Citric Acid, Pisum Sativum Seed Extract, Citrus Aurantium Amara Leaf Oil, Cedrus Deodara Wood Oil, Caffeine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Benzoate.'
